# Invexio Project Overview

Invexio is an inventory management web app connected to WooCommerce.

The app should help users:
- View products.
- Search and filter products.
- Update inventory.
- Add manual orders.
- Sync products and orders with WooCommerce.
- Track inventory movements.
- See sync errors and retry them.

Architecture:
- Next.js App Router.
- TypeScript.
- Tailwind CSS.
- Supabase Postgres.
- Supabase Auth.
- WooCommerce REST API.
- Vercel deployment.

WooCommerce should be treated as the external commerce system.
Supabase should be the app database and local source for fast reads, audit logs, roles, and sync history.

Do not make the frontend call WooCommerce directly.
WooCommerce API calls must go through server-side functions only.